# The cases that are not run, one rule per line: <glob or path> TAB <class> TAB <reason>.
#
# A case here is EXCLUDED: it is never given to the runner and so cannot pass,
# but it stays in the headline denominator of the score (PASS over all cases).
# The score file also prints PASS over all cases but the excluded ones, labelled,
# so that the milestone's reach can be read without the second ratio ever being
# read as the first.
#
# The path is relative to the corpus's tests/ directory. A rule matches with
# fnmatch, where * crosses directories. Globs are for OUT_OF_SCOPE only: a
# directory of cases that one decision puts outside this milestone is one rule,
# not hundreds. ENVIRONMENT and REFERENCE rules name a case exactly.
#
# The classes are closed: OUT_OF_SCOPE (a feature this milestone does not read,
# the reason naming the non-goal or the phase that excludes it), ENVIRONMENT (a
# case that needs something the harness does not provide), REFERENCE (a case
# whose reference the oracles show to be wrong, the reason giving the evidence).
# score.py fails on an unknown class, a reason of fewer than three words, a rule
# that matches no case, a case matched by two rules, and a glob outside
# OUT_OF_SCOPE.
filters/*	OUT_OF_SCOPE	filters are milestone 1 non-goal, read in a later milestone
text/direction/*	OUT_OF_SCOPE	this text property is read in a later story of milestone 3
text/font-size-adjust/*	OUT_OF_SCOPE	this text property is read in a later story of milestone 3
text/glyph-orientation-horizontal/*	OUT_OF_SCOPE	this text property is read in a later story of milestone 3
text/glyph-orientation-vertical/*	OUT_OF_SCOPE	this text property is read in a later story of milestone 3
text/textPath/*	OUT_OF_SCOPE	this text property is read in a later story of milestone 3
text/tref/*	OUT_OF_SCOPE	this text property is read in a later story of milestone 3
text/unicode-bidi/*	OUT_OF_SCOPE	this text property is read in a later story of milestone 3
text/writing-mode/*	OUT_OF_SCOPE	this text property is read in a later story of milestone 3
structure/image/*	OUT_OF_SCOPE	the image element is a milestone 1 non-goal, read in a later milestone
painting/image-rendering/*	OUT_OF_SCOPE	image rendering applies to the image element, a milestone 1 non-goal, read in a later milestone
